# NOT ignored, on purpose: index.html and start.html. They are build artifacts
# rendered from *.template.html, but this repo is the mirror of what is actually
# SERVED — index.json, methodology.html and institutions/** are generated and
# committed for the same reason. Ignoring the artifacts would leave the history
# unable to answer "what did the site say on the day it was cited?"
# Both the templates and the rendered pages belong in here.
